1
00:00:11,200 --> 00:00:18,260
♪If I am gone from this world,
will the dark night collapse?♪

2
00:00:18,880 --> 00:00:25,820
♪If I never return
to guard by your side♪

3
00:00:26,270 --> 00:00:30,800
♪If I seal away our encounter
and erase all trace♪

4
00:00:31,010 --> 00:00:33,900
♪Like endless snow
falling into the deep sea♪

5
00:00:33,972 --> 00:00:40,272
♪This life is but a fleeting illusion,
yet it gave me courage♪

6
00:00:40,510 --> 00:00:41,740
♪Love is a miracle♪

7
00:00:41,740 --> 00:00:42,920
=Spring Over Phoenix Pond=

8
00:00:42,920 --> 00:00:45,300
(Adapted from Qin An'an's
"Spring Over Phoenix Pond")

9
00:00:45,340 --> 00:00:48,260
=Episode 12=

10
00:00:48,470 --> 00:00:49,390
Miss Qi,

11
00:00:49,560 --> 00:00:50,520
enjoying yourself?

12
00:01:01,390 --> 00:01:02,430
Yueying Pleasure House

13
00:01:03,110 --> 00:01:04,790
is Prince Qi's private brothel.

14
00:01:04,950 --> 00:01:06,680
If you don't want to give yourself away,

15
00:01:06,870 --> 00:01:08,760
act like a regular.

16
00:01:21,000 --> 00:01:22,040
Sir,

17
00:01:22,680 --> 00:01:24,040
is this your first time here?

18
00:01:24,950 --> 00:01:27,040
Would you like me to keep you company?

19
00:01:27,430 --> 00:01:28,510
Miss,

20
00:01:28,840 --> 00:01:29,950
I'm new here.

21
00:01:30,150 --> 00:01:32,430
It's not often I get a customer.

22
00:01:32,430 --> 00:01:34,200
Please don't take him from me.

23
00:01:34,350 --> 00:01:35,310
Sir...

24
00:01:35,760 --> 00:01:36,560
Mister.

25
00:01:42,120 --> 00:01:43,350
This gentleman

26
00:01:44,430 --> 00:01:46,280
is mine.

27
00:01:46,760 --> 00:01:50,400
Cut me some slack.

28
00:01:53,510 --> 00:01:54,640
Fine, then.

29
00:02:03,560 --> 00:02:04,560
So

30
00:02:04,640 --> 00:02:06,480
I'm Miss Qi's man now?

31
00:02:22,430 --> 00:02:24,240
A prince running a brothel is improper,

32
00:02:24,240 --> 00:02:25,280
but hardly enough to bring him doom.

33
00:02:25,280 --> 00:02:26,240
At least tell me

34
00:02:26,310 --> 00:02:27,400
what we're looking into.

35
00:02:28,190 --> 00:02:29,840
What if behind these gilded doors

36
00:02:30,120 --> 00:02:32,470
are respectable women
who were kidnapped and sold?

37
00:02:35,630 --> 00:02:36,710
Are you saying

38
00:02:37,710 --> 00:02:39,190
Prince Qi

39
00:02:39,400 --> 00:02:40,630
is trafficking women

40
00:02:40,630 --> 00:02:41,150
and forcing them into prostitution?

41
00:02:41,150 --> 00:02:41,710
Hush.

42
00:02:48,000 --> 00:02:50,620
The Vice Minister of the Court
of Judicial Review, who oversees the law,

43
00:02:50,630 --> 00:02:51,710
is a frequent guest here.

44
00:02:51,800 --> 00:02:52,870
Why wouldn't he dare to do that?

45
00:02:53,800 --> 00:02:55,200
I mustn't let him get away with it.

46
00:02:56,810 --> 00:02:57,400
Your Highness,

47
00:02:57,750 --> 00:02:59,240
a runner from Yueying Pleasure House

48
00:02:59,560 --> 00:03:00,240
just reported

49
00:03:00,520 --> 00:03:02,120
that Qi Yuan was seen there tonight.

50
00:03:02,310 --> 00:03:03,030
- What?
- What?

51
00:03:04,500 --> 00:03:06,460
I'll have Yueying Pleasure House
cleaned out at once

52
00:03:06,470 --> 00:03:07,840
and leave no loose ends.

53
00:03:07,960 --> 00:03:08,680
Wait.

54
00:03:09,680 --> 00:03:10,830
Since she's gone to such lengths

55
00:03:10,840 --> 00:03:12,960
to walk into my cage,

56
00:03:13,280 --> 00:03:14,960
I'll indulge her.

57
00:03:15,380 --> 00:03:16,990
I'll search the secret chamber
in the backyard

58
00:03:17,000 --> 00:03:18,870
for the kidnapped women.

59
00:03:19,560 --> 00:03:21,590
But to prove Prince Qi is behind this,

60
00:03:21,910 --> 00:03:22,630
I need you

61
00:03:23,030 --> 00:03:23,710
to find

62
00:03:23,710 --> 00:03:25,680
Hong Xiao, the top courtesan

63
00:03:25,680 --> 00:03:26,700
who manages this brothel.

64
00:03:27,560 --> 00:03:28,360
We'll split up.

65
00:03:29,120 --> 00:03:29,710
Hold on.

66
00:03:35,840 --> 00:03:36,560
What is this for?

67
00:03:38,840 --> 00:03:40,590
Liujin is waiting outside.

68
00:03:41,090 --> 00:03:42,030
If anything goes wrong,

69
00:03:42,030 --> 00:03:43,080
blow this whistle

70
00:03:43,590 --> 00:03:45,080
and summon him.

71
00:03:49,680 --> 00:03:50,280
Thanks.

72
00:04:14,870 --> 00:04:16,390
What I enjoy most

73
00:04:16,720 --> 00:04:19,040
is taming stubborn ones like you.

74
00:04:20,000 --> 00:04:21,040
Qi Yuan.

75
00:04:23,950 --> 00:04:25,040
Prince Qi.

76
00:04:25,720 --> 00:04:27,120
Do you find this room

77
00:04:27,120 --> 00:04:28,680
familiar?

78
00:04:29,750 --> 00:04:30,720
Once again,

79
00:04:30,720 --> 00:04:32,830
you've fallen into my hands.

80
00:04:32,870 --> 00:04:34,390
I'd like to see

81
00:04:34,920 --> 00:04:36,000
whether you'll still

82
00:04:36,000 --> 00:04:37,830
be so defiant

83
00:04:37,830 --> 00:04:39,560
after every bone in your body is broken.

84
00:04:40,040 --> 00:04:42,000
I killed you in our last life.

85
00:04:42,190 --> 00:04:45,390
I can do it again in this one.

86
00:04:49,630 --> 00:04:50,270
Guards!

87
00:04:51,560 --> 00:04:52,680
Since you know

88
00:04:52,680 --> 00:04:54,480
I'd come looking for evidence,

89
00:04:55,000 --> 00:04:57,190
did you think I'd come unprepared?

90
00:04:57,390 --> 00:04:59,070
This is the deadliest poison.

91
00:04:59,870 --> 00:05:00,600
Tell me.

92
00:05:00,920 --> 00:05:02,390
Where are the girls?

93
00:05:03,040 --> 00:05:04,560
Give me the antidote first,

94
00:05:05,430 --> 00:05:06,630
and I'll tell you.

95
00:05:23,310 --> 00:05:24,120
Speak.

96
00:05:24,360 --> 00:05:25,630
Where are the girls?

97
00:05:27,630 --> 00:05:30,240
So this is how you like it?

98
00:05:34,750 --> 00:05:36,270
They're at Qiyun Manor, aren't they?

99
00:05:38,750 --> 00:05:40,480
You smell of osmanthus.

100
00:05:41,310 --> 00:05:45,040
Only Qiyun Manor grows those flowers.

101
00:05:47,920 --> 00:05:49,360
If I die,

102
00:05:50,360 --> 00:05:52,560
they'll all be buried with me.

103
00:06:01,040 --> 00:06:01,750
Don't you dare!

104
00:06:02,190 --> 00:06:03,000
Don't you dare!

105
00:06:14,270 --> 00:06:15,830
You!

106
00:06:19,920 --> 00:06:20,560
Your Highness!

107
00:06:20,950 --> 00:06:21,950
One more step

108
00:06:21,950 --> 00:06:23,360
and he dies.

109
00:06:23,680 --> 00:06:24,310
Stop.

110
00:06:24,600 --> 00:06:25,510
All of you, stop.

111
00:06:27,240 --> 00:06:27,750
You...

112
00:06:28,680 --> 00:06:29,800
Leave the antidote,

113
00:06:30,040 --> 00:06:31,190
and I'll let you go.

114
00:06:33,160 --> 00:06:34,040
Antidote?

115
00:06:36,950 --> 00:06:38,070
There isn't one.

116
00:06:39,360 --> 00:06:42,630
Only medicine that makes you impotent.

117
00:06:44,830 --> 00:06:46,600
Every man in this room
has been poisoned,

118
00:06:47,190 --> 00:06:48,390
just like you.

119
00:06:50,800 --> 00:06:51,190
You!

120
00:06:53,240 --> 00:06:54,120
Witch!

121
00:06:57,260 --> 00:06:57,830
Your Highness.

122
00:07:03,330 --> 00:07:03,900
Your Highness.

123
00:07:05,240 --> 00:07:06,310
Except the honored guests,

124
00:07:07,160 --> 00:07:09,120
leave no one alive
in Yueying Pleasure House.

125
00:07:09,720 --> 00:07:11,800
Especially Hong Xiao.

126
00:07:26,190 --> 00:07:27,600
His Highness sent me to kill you.

127
00:07:27,600 --> 00:07:28,390
Impossible.

128
00:07:28,400 --> 00:07:29,800
I've run Yueying Pleasure House
for years.

129
00:07:29,800 --> 00:07:30,940
(Hong Xiao, top courtesan of Yueying Pleasure House)
He'd never kill me.

130
00:07:30,940 --> 00:07:31,780
(Lin Chun'er, young courtesan)
Take me to him.

131
00:07:35,920 --> 00:07:36,800
You're Hong Xiao?

132
00:07:37,700 --> 00:07:38,750
Is there a secret passage?

133
00:07:42,900 --> 00:07:43,820
(Jing)

134
00:07:44,360 --> 00:07:45,560
You're Prince Jing?

135
00:07:46,190 --> 00:07:47,480
If you want to live, trust me.

136
00:07:50,040 --> 00:07:50,720
There is.

137
00:07:50,720 --> 00:07:51,600
Under my bed.

138
00:07:51,610 --> 00:07:52,680
Leave through the secret passage

139
00:07:52,680 --> 00:07:53,510
and head straight for my residence.

140
00:07:53,510 --> 00:07:54,660
Someone will meet you there.

141
00:07:54,750 --> 00:07:55,630
Are you not leaving?

142
00:07:56,580 --> 00:07:57,430
I have people to save.

143
00:07:57,450 --> 00:07:58,580
Where's the secret chamber?

144
00:07:58,920 --> 00:07:59,560
That way.

145
00:08:01,800 --> 00:08:02,360
Let's go.

146
00:08:08,500 --> 00:08:09,250
Where's Hong Xiao?

147
00:08:09,270 --> 00:08:09,990
Did you find her?

148
00:08:10,190 --> 00:08:10,680
I did.

149
00:08:10,690 --> 00:08:11,510
She escaped through the secret passage

150
00:08:11,510 --> 00:08:12,360
to my residence.

151
00:08:12,360 --> 00:08:13,510
Why are you charging back in?

152
00:08:13,600 --> 00:08:14,830
Do you think you're invincible?

153
00:08:14,840 --> 00:08:15,870
You're still here, aren't you?

154
00:08:15,920 --> 00:08:17,070
How could I leave alone?

155
00:08:18,040 --> 00:08:18,390
Let's go.

156
00:09:25,670 --> 00:09:27,200
Trying to run?

157
00:09:28,910 --> 00:09:31,200
Neither of you is leaving alive.

158
00:09:31,840 --> 00:09:32,480
Where's Liujin?

159
00:09:33,000 --> 00:09:34,790
I sent him to Qiyun Manor
to save the girls.

160
00:09:35,240 --> 00:09:36,120
Looks like

161
00:09:36,240 --> 00:09:38,000
we'll have to find our own way out.

162
00:09:39,030 --> 00:09:39,790
Fire.

163
00:10:44,950 --> 00:10:49,590
♪How I wish to hold onto
this fleeting warmth♪

164
00:10:49,970 --> 00:10:53,750
♪How I wish to live this life
only for you♪

165
00:10:54,260 --> 00:10:59,720
♪When memories sink
and the heart settles♪

166
00:10:59,940 --> 00:11:04,100
♪Forgetting life, death,
parting, and reunion♪

167
00:11:04,890 --> 00:11:09,170
♪How I wish to stay
only in the moment with you♪

168
00:11:09,970 --> 00:11:16,870
♪Anchoring myself by your side♪
